    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "It is precisely this difference of relative magnitudes, this Aristotelian “excess and defect” in the case of form, which our co-ordinate method is especially adapted to analyse, and to reveal and demonstrate as the main cause of what (again in the Aristotelian sense) we term “specific” differences." ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/55264> ;
